    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it just feels so... performative. like, people say \"it matters\" but objectively, in a billion years, none of this exists. the math just doesn't add up to anything meaningful. it's hard not to feel like struggling through it all is just fighting an inevitable nothingness.",
